  "title": "Christina Geller to Lead Wholesale Financial Lines at AXIS",
  "summary": "Christina Geller to Lead Wholesale Financial Lines at AXIS PEMBROKE, Bermuda, June 3, 2026-AXIS Capital Holdings Limited (AXIS Capital or AXIS or the Company) (NYSE: AXS), today announced the promotion of Christina Geller to Head of Wholesale Financial Lines in North America. Previously, Ms. Geller served as Head of Wholesale Financial Institutions. She has spent a combined 18 years serving in senior underwriting and leadership positions within AXIS from 2005 to 2012 and then returning to the firm from 2013 to present. Reporting to John Van Decker, Head of Global Financial Lines, Ms. Geller will develop and deliver the strategy for long-term profitable growth across",
